detaileddescription.para:
funcName
The name of the function as a string.
Example usage: BBL_InsertCall(bbl,IPOINT_BEFORE,MAKE_AFUNPTR(analysis_function_func_ptr), FUNC_NAME_IARG_STRING("analysis_function_func_ptr"),IARG_END);

func



The function name. Example usage: BBL_InsertCall(bbl,IPOINT_BEFORE,MAKE_AFUNPTR(analysis_function_iarg),FUNC_NAME_IARG(analysis_function_another_func),IARG_END);




Result of unfolding: BBL_InsertCall(bbl,IPOINT_BEFORE,MAKE_AFUNPTR(analysis_function_iarg),IARG_FUNC_NAME,"analysis_function_another_func",IARG_END);

func



The function name. Example usage: BBL_InsertCall(bbl,IPOINT_BEFORE,MAKE_AFUNPTR(analysis_function_func_name),IARG_END);




Result of unfolding: BBL_InsertCall(bbl,IPOINT_BEFORE,MAKE_AFUNPTR(analysis_function_func_name),IARG_FUNC_NAME,"analysis_function_func_name",IARG_END);
